                        "entry_id": "196adfb9-7f25-3286-a14b-2db87833894c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A law enacted by the plebs, under the superintendence of a tribune or some subordinate plebeian magistrate, without the senate's intervention."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ancient-Rome"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
