                                "sense_id": "f006ad8b-4d96-3bb1-8213-90df6226b349",
                                "text": "The propositions of M[axime] du Camp are as follows: […] 3. No war to be declared before it has been submitted to a plebiscitum of the nations preparing to take part in it."
                            }
                        ]
